<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Data Systems cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Data Systems cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview Financial said analyst Gary Helmig downgraded Electronic Data Systems Corp to short-term hold from buy and kept the long-term rating at buy.</p>
<p>-- reduced the 1997 earnings estimate to $2.31 from $2.40.</p>
<p>-- shares dropped 5/8 to 42-5/8.</p>
</text>
